## ConversionDeletionRequestsApi

### Create a conversion deletion request
## Create a conversion deletion request
POST https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/conversion_deletion_requests
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 "deletion_targets": "<string>"
}


### Delete a conversion deletion request
## Delete a conversion deletion request
DELETE https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/conversion_deletion_requests/{{request_id}}
Accept: application/json

### Get a single conversion deletion request
## Get a single conversion deletion request
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/conversion_deletion_requests/{{request_id}}
Accept: application/json

### List conversion deletion requests
## List conversion deletion requests
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/conversion_deletion_requests?bookmark={{bookmark}}&pageSize={{pageSize}}&order={{order}}
Accept: application/json
